{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02901","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 二 · 裴守真","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云路移彤辇，天津转明镜。\n仙珠照乘归，宝月重轮映。\n望园嘉宴洽，主第欢娱盛。\n丝竹扬帝熏，簪裾奉宸庆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴守真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}